<article class="env-lemma" id="0CZA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CZA">Lemma <span data-tag="0CZA">71.5.7</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be an $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module of finite presentation. Let $X = Z_{-1} \subset Z_0 \subset Z_1 \subset \ldots $ be as in Lemma <a href="/tag/0CZ9" data-tag="0CZ9">71.5.6</a>. Set $X_ r = Z_{r - 1} \setminus Z_ r$. Then $X' = \coprod _{r \geq 0} X_ r$ represents the functor </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  F_{flat} : \mathit{Sch}/X \longrightarrow \textit{Sets},\quad \quad T \longmapsto \left\{  \begin{matrix}  \{ *\}  

&  \text{if }\mathcal{F}_ T\text{ flat over }T

\\  \emptyset 

&  \text{otherwise} 

\end{matrix} \right.  \]
</div>
  <p> Moreover, $\mathcal{F}|_{X_ r}$ is locally free of rank $r$ and the morphisms $X_ r \to X$ and $X' \to X$ are of finite presentation. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Reduces to Divisors, Lemma <a href="/tag/05P9" data-tag="05P9">31.9.7</a> by étale localization. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>